tes-header wprm-block-text-normal wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-no=
ne" style=3D"">Notes</h3><div class=3D"wprm-recipe-notes"><ul>
<li>I go up to about 1 tablespoon of hot sauce total in my dressing. I like=
 the zing and the hot sauce that I typically use for things like this (Chol=
ula) isn=E2=80=99t overly hot.&nbsp;</li>
<li>If you=E2=80=99re using coconut aminos in place of the Tamari, I would =
double the amount to 2 teaspoons.&nbsp;</li>
</ul></div></div>
